        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamuni akuma hayyu tahe irre horateeni isaafi worri isaa ch'ufti Seera AABBO Waaqaa lakisani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganna shaneeso ka inni lafa mohate, waan worri AABBO Waaqa lakiseefi, hayyuuni Misiri, ka Shishaki jed'ani, d'ufe Yerusalemu had'e. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni askarti gaarini yaatu, nama kuma tokotifi d'ibba lama qaba, ammalle ta fardaani yaatule nama kuma jaatama qaba, ammalle askarti heddu, muumme inqamne d'ibi, ta gosa Lubitifi Sukiitifi Kushi qaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inni dira jabeesani jaarani ka lafa Yuda dabsate Yerusalemuni bahe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Raagi Shemaini gara Rehoboamutifi jaarole Yuda ta Shishaki baqate Yerusalemuti wolti baate, d'aqe waan jed'eeni, AABBO Waaqi waan jed'u, Waan isani qara na lakiftanifi, anini amma harka Shishakiti isani lakisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hayyufi jaaroleeni taani wollaala ufi agarte waan jette, AABBO Waaqi d'uga qaba, ka waan kana nu tolchu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi herega worra suni arge jennaani ammalle Shemaini dubbate waan jed'eeni, Maro worri wollaala ufi fud'ateefi anini amma worra imballeesu. Hojja Shishakini worra had'ele, anini isa worra hobaasu d'owe, dallansu tiyya ch'ufa Yerusalemu hanqisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo hataatuti, inni inuma worra dabsata, aka akasiini worri finna kiyyafi ka nama lafa gargari hubatu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
